-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  std_hookio_stream_text_unget.adam - ungetc and scans from C on a virtual
  file and on a real file of the same bytes (PaskalCPP's std_hookio
  TestStreamTextUnget)

  Every short and long sample through "rt", "r" and "rb": every slot
  equals the real file's (Windows text mode: ungetc into ucrt's buffer, a
  second one refused at its front, a scan's look-ahead that refills it).
*******************************************************************************/

